WEBVTT

01:37.780 --> 01:43.009
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.110 --> 01:43.650
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.729 --> 01:45.800
[Episode 2]

01:56.229 --> 01:57.710
Master, latest news:

01:57.710 --> 01:59.310
the puppet doll has appeared
in Dougu County,

01:59.310 --> 02:00.640
and its trail ends in Black Wind Forest.

02:00.640 --> 02:01.400
Constable Ghost Meng Rui has also

02:01.400 --> 02:02.790
headed toward Dougu.

02:19.620 --> 02:26.850
[The Immortal Flower:
The Missing Children Case]

02:26.960 --> 02:29.490
[Law Prevails]

02:28.030 --> 02:30.079
The recent case files
submitted by Suzhou report that

02:29.590 --> 02:31.620
[Proceedings Before the County Magistrate]
[Children Missing in Dougu County, Suzhou]

02:30.630 --> 02:31.890
over the past 2 months,

02:31.910 --> 02:33.000
a total of 29 children

02:33.000 --> 02:35.800
have gone missing in Dougu County.

02:35.820 --> 02:36.710
There have also

02:36.910 --> 02:37.960
been sightings of

02:37.960 --> 02:39.079
the puppet doll.

02:41.280 --> 02:43.840
The case of the missing girls
in Tianhuang City remains unsolved,

02:43.840 --> 02:44.700
and now there are

02:44.700 --> 02:46.590
new cases of missing children
in Dougu County—

02:46.590 --> 02:49.240
both involving traces of the puppet doll.

02:50.310 --> 02:51.490
There must be a connection

02:51.490 --> 02:52.680
between the two.

02:54.040 --> 02:55.880
Constable Ghost Meng Rui, heed my command!

02:55.880 --> 02:56.870
Yes, My Lady.

02:56.910 --> 02:58.730
Set out overnight for Dougu County

02:58.730 --> 03:00.630
to investigate the case of
the missing children.

03:00.630 --> 03:01.430
Understood.

03:01.840 --> 03:03.190
[Over the past 2 months,]

03:03.190 --> 03:04.080
[a total of 29 children]

03:04.080 --> 03:06.210
[have been reported missing
within the county.]

03:06.210 --> 03:07.520
[Witnesses also claim]

03:07.090 --> 03:10.200
[Dougu County, Suzhou, Great Shi]

03:07.520 --> 03:08.590
[that the puppet doll]

03:08.590 --> 03:10.910
[has repeatedly been seen
at the time of the incidents.]

03:10.910 --> 03:11.910
[All residents are hereby urged]

03:11.910 --> 03:13.910
[to keep a close watch
over their children,]

03:13.910 --> 03:15.190
[shut doors early in the evening,]

03:14.300 --> 03:17.470
[Proclamation to the People
of Dougu County]

03:15.190 --> 03:16.590
[and not allow them to go out alone.]

03:16.590 --> 03:18.680
[Anyone who spots traces of
the puppet doll]

03:18.680 --> 03:20.310
[must report immediately to
the authorities.]

03:20.310 --> 03:21.430
[Rewards will be given whether
the information proves true or false.]

03:21.430 --> 03:23.160
Sir, what would you like to eat?

03:23.520 --> 03:24.310
Boss,

03:24.710 --> 03:26.120
so many children

03:26.310 --> 03:28.240
have gone missing in your Dougu County?

03:28.240 --> 03:29.240
Exactly.

03:29.310 --> 03:30.800
Twenty-nine of them.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.590
It's got everyone on edge.

03:32.680 --> 03:33.910
And what's with

03:33.910 --> 03:35.470
the puppet doll

03:35.680 --> 03:37.240
mentioned on this proclamation?

03:37.240 --> 03:38.120
Someone saw

03:38.280 --> 03:39.030
that kid

03:39.030 --> 03:40.760
was taken away by a puppet doll.

03:41.310 --> 03:42.910
How weird is that?

03:44.590 --> 03:45.400
Boss,

03:45.430 --> 03:46.310
are the noodles ready?

03:46.310 --> 03:46.710
Hurry up!

03:46.710 --> 03:48.520
-Coming right up. Just a second.
-We've been waiting for ages!

03:48.520 --> 03:50.120
Just a second. Just a second.

03:51.030 --> 03:51.840
Eat!

03:56.120 --> 03:57.310
You little brat!

03:57.470 --> 03:58.870
Boss, don't worry about her.

03:58.870 --> 04:00.000
Even if she starves to death,

04:00.000 --> 04:01.590
we can still get the money.

04:01.590 --> 04:03.030
Keep your voice down!

04:07.680 --> 04:08.540
Everyone, stop eating.

04:08.540 --> 04:09.820
Bro, let's go!

04:10.120 --> 04:10.910
Let's go!

04:10.910 --> 04:11.470
Come with us!

04:11.470 --> 04:12.190
Come on. Come on!

04:12.190 --> 04:12.870
Move!

04:12.870 --> 04:13.590
Hurry up!

04:13.590 --> 04:14.120
Hurry!

04:14.120 --> 04:14.630
Move!

04:15.560 --> 04:19.060
[Noodles]

04:15.800 --> 04:17.720
According to the law of the Great Shi,

04:17.720 --> 04:19.800
those who abduct or sell children

04:20.070 --> 04:21.510
shall be branded on the face,

04:21.510 --> 04:23.040
given 100 strokes of the rod,

04:23.040 --> 04:24.170
and exiled 1,000 li.

04:26.120 --> 04:28.580
Where did you death-seeking brat
come from?

04:28.680 --> 04:29.630
Pretty boy.

04:30.310 --> 04:31.720
You must be from another city.

04:31.720 --> 04:32.680
Let me tell you—

04:32.920 --> 04:34.780
in the territory of Dougu County,

04:35.000 --> 04:36.600
even dragons have to coil up

04:36.600 --> 04:38.730
and even tigers have to lie down for me.

04:39.070 --> 04:41.190
Don't try to tell me what to do.

04:41.630 --> 04:42.830
Here's my advice:

04:43.240 --> 04:46.310
keep your head down
and mind your own business.

04:46.310 --> 04:47.600
Do you know who we are?

04:48.040 --> 04:50.170
It would scare you to death if I told you!

04:50.170 --> 04:51.670
[Noodles]

05:00.000 --> 05:01.310
Do you want to die?

05:10.580 --> 05:12.640
[Noodles]

05:20.870 --> 05:21.680
Little girl.

05:22.310 --> 05:23.120
Come here.

05:26.120 --> 05:26.920
Are you okay?

05:31.510 --> 05:32.310
Just now,

05:33.070 --> 05:34.310
which one of you said

05:34.600 --> 05:35.600
I didn't know who you are?

05:35.600 --> 05:38.360
Go on then, you can tell me now.
I'm ready to be scared.

05:38.360 --> 05:39.120
Please spare my life, My Lord!

05:39.120 --> 05:41.510
-Let me ask you.
-I was blind to your identity.

05:41.510 --> 05:43.630
Were the children mentioned
on that proclamation

05:43.630 --> 05:45.340
all abducted by you guys?

05:45.480 --> 05:46.800
No, no, no, hero!

05:46.870 --> 05:49.190
That has nothing to do with us!

05:49.480 --> 05:50.870
Our boss only took us

05:50.870 --> 05:52.680
to abduct this one child.

05:52.680 --> 05:53.560
We were just discussing

05:53.560 --> 05:55.040
how to trade her for money

05:55.070 --> 05:56.310
when we ran into you.

05:56.310 --> 05:56.600
Yeah, yeah.

05:56.600 --> 05:57.120
Just this one.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.120
We know we were wrong!

05:58.120 --> 06:00.190
-We know we were wrong!
-We know we were wrong!

06:00.190 --> 06:01.000
You lot—

06:01.830 --> 06:03.830
go to the county government
and turn yourself in.

06:03.830 --> 06:05.290
If any of you try to flee...

06:10.830 --> 06:11.890
Do you understand?

06:12.480 --> 06:16.740
-Thank you, My Lord! Thank you, My Lord!
-We'll turn ourselves in right away!

06:19.870 --> 06:20.390
Hurry.

06:20.510 --> 06:21.310
Are you okay?

06:26.920 --> 06:28.430
Please enjoy, sir.

06:29.270 --> 06:30.510
Here. For the noodles.

06:30.510 --> 06:31.310
Thank you.

06:43.390 --> 06:44.390
You want to see me?

06:46.630 --> 06:47.680
What's your name?

06:48.000 --> 06:49.460
Sun Yuyao.

06:51.070 --> 06:52.530
Anything you want from me?

06:59.300 --> 07:01.110
[Proclamation]

07:04.150 --> 07:05.420
Who gave you this?

07:05.720 --> 07:07.070
Mr. Young Master.

07:08.500 --> 07:09.590
Mr. Young Master?

07:11.240 --> 07:12.120
Could it be...

07:13.000 --> 07:13.800
Boss.

07:14.630 --> 07:15.430
Sir.

07:15.870 --> 07:16.720
Boss.

07:16.870 --> 07:18.130
Have you seen this man?

07:20.040 --> 07:21.240
It was this gentleman

07:21.270 --> 07:22.680
who rescued the girl from the bandits

07:22.680 --> 07:23.810
of Niutou Mountain.

07:23.830 --> 07:24.630
Are you sure?

07:25.680 --> 07:26.630
Of course.

07:26.720 --> 07:27.800
A face like his

07:28.040 --> 07:29.510
is one in a million.

07:30.270 --> 07:31.870
He actually came here too.

07:33.750 --> 07:34.510
Did you see

07:34.530 --> 07:35.710
where he went?

07:36.310 --> 07:38.430
Toward the county town. That way.

07:42.830 --> 07:43.630
Yuyao.

07:43.870 --> 07:45.070
Do you want to go home?

07:46.870 --> 07:48.680
Mr. Young Master was right.

07:48.720 --> 07:50.480
I knew you'd take me home.

07:54.000 --> 07:55.530
Come on. I'll take you home.

07:58.120 --> 07:58.920
Sir. Sir.

07:59.630 --> 08:00.430
Sir.

08:01.090 --> 08:02.600
Do you think I should go collect my reward

08:02.600 --> 08:03.830
at the Divine Constable Bureau

08:03.830 --> 08:04.600
or...

08:06.430 --> 08:07.190
Here.

08:07.280 --> 08:07.920
Thank you, sir.

08:07.920 --> 08:08.430
Let's go.

08:08.430 --> 08:09.630
Thank you. Thank you.

08:10.070 --> 08:11.870
Thank you, sir. Take care.

08:13.510 --> 08:14.430
Well done.

08:14.920 --> 08:16.190
Here. As I promised.

08:15.320 --> 08:15.670
[Proclamation]

08:18.830 --> 08:19.630
Boss.

08:20.240 --> 08:21.640
It's only been half a day,

08:21.720 --> 08:22.720
and you've already earned

08:22.720 --> 08:24.270
40 taels overall.

08:24.570 --> 08:25.240
Sir.

08:25.270 --> 08:26.270
You kept your word—

08:26.270 --> 08:27.510
what admirable character.

08:27.340 --> 08:29.480
[Proclamation]

08:27.720 --> 08:29.070
That officer from just now

08:29.070 --> 08:30.430
doesn't look like
someone to be trifled with.

08:30.430 --> 08:32.270
You'd better leave early.

08:32.870 --> 08:34.870
Who said I was leaving Dougu County?

08:35.270 --> 08:37.669
I'm even worried
he won't be able to find me.

08:38.840 --> 08:39.870
Thank you, sir!

08:39.870 --> 08:41.630
Go get your master to come out
and see patients.

08:41.630 --> 08:42.909
Please be quiet, everyone.

08:42.909 --> 08:44.120
Listen to me, everyone.

08:43.020 --> 08:45.970
[Chunfeng Hall]

08:44.270 --> 08:46.510
Master has been deeply worried

08:46.600 --> 08:48.200
due to his daughter's disappearance.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.510
He's not seeing patients for now.

08:49.510 --> 08:50.340
Not seeing patients?

08:50.340 --> 08:50.860
-That's right.
-Not seeing patients?

08:50.860 --> 08:51.690
This won't do.

08:51.720 --> 08:52.770
So including Yuyao,

08:52.770 --> 08:53.600
that makes

08:53.600 --> 08:54.790
30 children missing, right?

08:54.790 --> 08:55.550
What on earth has our Dougu County

08:55.550 --> 08:57.240
-done to deserve this?
-Sir.

08:57.240 --> 08:58.600
-My house is right ahead.
-Those missing children.

08:58.600 --> 09:00.480
Their parents must be super worried.

09:00.480 --> 09:01.510
The puppet that abducted people—

09:01.510 --> 09:02.510
-Yuyao?
-Is it a human or a ghost?

09:02.510 --> 09:03.360
Yuyao, you're back!

09:03.360 --> 09:04.120
My Lady!

09:04.670 --> 09:06.200
My Lady, you're back!

09:06.200 --> 09:07.440
Mr. Wang.

09:09.030 --> 09:10.510
Sir, may I ask who you are?

09:10.720 --> 09:11.840
It was this gentleman

09:11.840 --> 09:13.120
who brought me home.

09:14.050 --> 09:20.070
[Chunfeng Hall]

09:14.910 --> 09:16.030
Esteemed hero.

09:16.200 --> 09:18.030
By bringing our young lady back,

09:18.120 --> 09:18.840
you've saved the lives

09:18.840 --> 09:20.630
of our master and madam.

09:21.030 --> 09:22.430
Please. No need for this.

09:22.840 --> 09:24.120
Now that Yuyao is back,

09:24.120 --> 09:25.630
go tell your master to open the clinic
and start seeing patients again.

09:25.630 --> 09:26.720
-Yeah.
-That's right.

09:26.720 --> 09:27.670
Mother.

09:27.840 --> 09:29.500
My tooth hurts!

09:30.030 --> 09:31.120
Mr. Wang, look.

09:31.120 --> 09:31.790
Our Yuanbao

09:31.790 --> 09:32.670
is at the age of losing his baby teeth.

09:32.670 --> 09:34.120
He's been complaining of tooth pain.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.080
Please ask Master Sun

09:35.080 --> 09:36.480
to come out and take a look at him.

09:36.480 --> 09:37.030
If he really can't see him,

09:37.030 --> 09:37.870
he could at least write us a prescription—

09:37.870 --> 09:38.320
we can go home

09:38.320 --> 09:39.790
and decoct the medicine ourselves.

09:39.790 --> 09:41.120
Mrs. Hua, this...

09:42.380 --> 09:44.270
[Chunfeng Hall]

09:43.030 --> 09:43.790
Hurry up. Come on.

09:43.790 --> 09:44.990
Be careful. Let's go.

09:46.000 --> 09:47.080
Officer!

09:47.670 --> 09:48.910
It's Master! He...

09:53.120 --> 09:54.000
Father!

09:54.000 --> 09:54.870
Take Yuyao away.

09:54.870 --> 09:55.510
Father!

09:55.510 --> 09:57.870
-Father!
-Everyone, please go home.

09:57.870 --> 09:59.510
-Just go home, everyone!
-Father!

09:59.510 --> 10:01.000
Break it up, everyone.

10:44.210 --> 10:45.820
What a peculiar scent.

11:08.110 --> 11:10.290
[Chief Constable's Hall]

11:11.570 --> 11:13.540
[Chief Constable's Hall]

11:15.820 --> 11:17.820
[Chief Constable's Hall]

11:20.480 --> 11:21.670
Twenty-nine children in Dougu County

11:21.670 --> 11:22.600
have gone missing without a trace.

11:22.600 --> 11:24.390
Now there's the dismemberment case
of the proprietor of Chunfeng Hall—

11:24.390 --> 11:25.910
threads were found tangled
among the severed limbs,

11:25.910 --> 11:27.240
along with a peculiar scent.

11:26.060 --> 11:29.070
[Chief Constable's Hall]

11:27.480 --> 11:29.880
And Li Si has also appeared
in Dougu County.

11:32.000 --> 11:33.510
The victim's body shows no visible wounds,

11:33.510 --> 11:35.370
and the murder weapon is unknown.

11:35.720 --> 11:36.740
The skin is slightly damaged.

11:36.740 --> 11:37.740
Wet it with water,

11:38.080 --> 11:40.340
then apply mashed scallion whites on it.

12:21.270 --> 12:23.470
Rinse it off, and the marks will appear.

12:29.870 --> 12:31.320
Such fine needle marks.

12:37.240 --> 12:38.000
The weapon must be

12:38.000 --> 12:39.080
the threads used to

12:39.080 --> 12:40.480
control the puppet doll,

12:40.510 --> 12:42.040
piercing the blood vessels

12:42.080 --> 12:43.280
to draw the blood out.

12:48.080 --> 12:49.080
The threads sent back by

12:49.080 --> 12:50.100
Constable Ghost from Dougu County

12:50.100 --> 12:52.270
also carry the scent of Dead Bone Spice.

12:52.270 --> 12:53.320
If that's the case,

12:53.290 --> 12:56.360
[Clear as a Mirror]

12:53.450 --> 12:54.720
then the Dougu County case

12:54.720 --> 12:56.870
is indeed connected to
the Spice-Refining Case.

12:56.870 --> 12:59.080
It's very likely the work of
the same person.

12:59.080 --> 13:01.510
Twenty-nine children have vanished
without a trace,

13:01.510 --> 13:03.030
their fate still unknown.

13:03.670 --> 13:05.000
The entire Dougu County

13:05.080 --> 13:07.720
is in uproar, with grievances everywhere
and rumors spreading wildly,

13:07.720 --> 13:08.440
even reaching

13:08.440 --> 13:10.240
Tianhuang City.

13:10.270 --> 13:11.670
Judging by the timeline,

13:11.790 --> 13:13.270
the child disappearance cases

13:13.270 --> 13:15.000
and the Young Girl Spice-Refining Case

13:15.000 --> 13:16.670
happened to occur in sequence.

13:16.670 --> 13:17.630
And just as Constable Ghost

13:17.630 --> 13:19.180
has been dispatched to investigate,

13:19.180 --> 13:22.180
[Clear as a Mirror]

13:19.510 --> 13:22.170
another dismemberment murder
has taken place.

13:22.480 --> 13:24.270
If all these incidents are indeed

13:24.270 --> 13:25.840
the work of the same person,

13:26.200 --> 13:27.390
then he must be plotting

13:27.390 --> 13:29.320
an earth-shattering conspiracy.

13:30.930 --> 13:36.400
[Clear as a Mirror]

13:31.440 --> 13:33.720
Constable Ghost also reported
something else—

13:33.720 --> 13:37.120
someone in Dougu County has claimed to
have seen Li Qingyang.

13:42.630 --> 13:44.320
Looks like this Young Master Qingyang

13:44.320 --> 13:45.980
is always one step ahead of us.

13:46.080 --> 13:46.910
What do you think

13:46.910 --> 13:47.970
about this person?

13:48.910 --> 13:50.080
If he were truly on the run,

13:50.080 --> 13:51.270
there are countless places
he could flee to—

13:51.270 --> 13:52.720
why choose Dougu County of all places?

13:52.720 --> 13:54.720
That couldn't have been a coincidence.

13:54.720 --> 13:55.870
Moreover, he once said

13:55.870 --> 13:57.600
he would personally avenge Qing Wu.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.790
So I believe

13:58.910 --> 13:59.670
that ever since the puppet doll

13:59.670 --> 14:00.910
was discovered at Star-Gathering Pavilion,

14:00.910 --> 14:01.910
he has been entangled in this case

14:01.910 --> 14:02.790
the entire time—

14:02.790 --> 14:04.520
he must be scheming something.

14:06.380 --> 14:11.890
[Clear as a Mirror]

14:07.910 --> 14:09.790
Li Si, Young Master Qingyang,

14:10.000 --> 14:12.240
was actually willing to throw himself
into the fray

14:12.240 --> 14:15.040
and even tried to break into
the Tianshu Pavilion—

14:15.200 --> 14:16.840
what exactly is he up to?

14:20.030 --> 14:20.840
For now,

14:20.870 --> 14:22.600
let's focus on solving the cases first.

14:22.600 --> 14:23.390
Zhenzhu,

14:23.510 --> 14:25.140
set out immediately to Dougu County

14:25.140 --> 14:26.630
to assist Constable Ghost.

14:26.630 --> 14:27.510
The female spice-maker murder,

14:27.510 --> 14:28.270
the missing children,

14:28.270 --> 14:29.510
and the proprietor dismemberment case—

14:29.510 --> 14:30.910
investigate these 3 cases together.

14:30.910 --> 14:31.720
Understood!

14:39.550 --> 14:42.080
[Dougu County Office]

14:40.870 --> 14:42.200
Who's beating the drum?

14:42.510 --> 14:44.570
Don't you know the court is off today?

14:48.920 --> 14:51.660
[Du Yi'an, Dougu County Magistrate]

14:54.420 --> 14:56.850
[Dougu County Office]

14:55.390 --> 14:57.080
Why are there so many people here today?

14:57.080 --> 14:57.910
My Lord.

14:58.480 --> 15:00.910
Our master was brutally killed at home,

15:00.910 --> 15:02.120
his body severed.

15:02.390 --> 15:04.600
I beg Your Lordship to quickly
apprehend the murderer

15:04.600 --> 15:07.080
and redress our grievance, My Lord!

15:07.080 --> 15:08.270
Got it. Got it.

15:08.690 --> 15:09.790
Leave the body here.

15:09.790 --> 15:11.250
You may all return for now.

15:11.320 --> 15:13.100
-My Lord! My Lord...
-What about you guys?

15:13.100 --> 15:14.280
My Lord,

15:14.310 --> 15:15.150
3 years ago,

15:15.150 --> 15:16.230
I robbed an old lady

15:16.250 --> 15:17.380
and took 80 coppers.

15:17.400 --> 15:18.480
Please, my merciful lord,

15:18.480 --> 15:19.510
lock me up!

15:19.510 --> 15:20.670
My Lord, I've also
committed robbery before!

15:20.670 --> 15:21.990
My Lord, please lock me up!

15:21.990 --> 15:23.080
You should arrest me.

15:23.080 --> 15:24.270
That old lady tried to
report me to the authorities later,

15:24.270 --> 15:25.480
and I gave her another beating.

15:25.480 --> 15:26.720
My sins are beyond forgiveness!

15:26.720 --> 15:27.910
We're bandits of Niutou Mountain.

15:27.910 --> 15:28.910
We've all lost our senses!

15:28.910 --> 15:29.270
My Lord!

15:29.270 --> 15:31.440
-Enough. That's enough!
-Our manager died unjustly.

15:31.440 --> 15:32.110
There aren't enough cells in the jail

15:32.110 --> 15:33.840
for that many people.

15:34.240 --> 15:35.100
How about this—

15:35.200 --> 15:36.080
come and register with the Advisor,

15:36.080 --> 15:37.030
take a number,

15:37.320 --> 15:38.320
and then go back to

15:38.570 --> 15:40.080
Niutou Mountain
and wait for further notice.

15:40.080 --> 15:42.000
When there are vacancies in the jail,

15:42.000 --> 15:43.360
you can come serve your sentence then.

15:43.360 --> 15:44.270
That won't do, My Lord!

15:44.270 --> 15:45.140
We won't be able to
live with our conscience!

15:45.140 --> 15:45.840
My Lord!

15:45.840 --> 15:47.080
Alright. Enough.

15:47.720 --> 15:49.920
Didn't you hear what His Lordship said?

15:50.320 --> 15:51.120
Break it up.

15:51.120 --> 15:52.030
Come on. Disperse.

15:52.030 --> 15:53.290
That won't do, My Lord!

15:54.630 --> 15:55.440
Stop it.

15:56.910 --> 15:59.000
Du Yi'an, Magistrate of Dougu County,

15:59.000 --> 15:59.870
don't you feel ashamed

15:59.870 --> 16:01.440
to wear that official cap?

16:03.000 --> 16:03.870
Who are you?

16:04.120 --> 16:06.640
How dare you address me so rudely?

16:06.910 --> 16:07.720
Guards.

16:07.750 --> 16:08.510
Take him down!

16:08.510 --> 16:09.200
Yes.

16:09.200 --> 16:10.000
Hold on!

16:14.720 --> 16:15.670
An iron plate?

16:16.510 --> 16:17.200
How dare you!

16:17.200 --> 16:18.510
How dare you ignore the law

16:18.510 --> 16:20.200
and bribe me in public?
That makes your crime even worse!

16:20.200 --> 16:21.240
M-My Lord.

16:20.850 --> 16:21.510
[Constable Ghost]

16:21.270 --> 16:22.080
What's wrong?

16:22.720 --> 16:24.270
These 4 characters read

16:24.270 --> 16:25.560
"Passed..."

16:26.510 --> 16:28.320
"Passed down through Generations."

16:28.320 --> 16:29.670
Even though he looks well-dressed,

16:29.670 --> 16:30.750
I could tell at a glance

16:30.750 --> 16:31.670
that he's a pauper.

16:31.560 --> 16:33.710
[Constable Ghost]

16:31.670 --> 16:32.870
That shabby iron plate he's holding

16:32.870 --> 16:33.910
is probably some
worthless family heirloom—

16:33.910 --> 16:35.440
not worth a second glance,
nothing special.

16:35.440 --> 16:36.840
No, My Lord.

16:37.630 --> 16:38.720
It says

16:39.840 --> 16:42.240
"Acting on Heaven's Authority to Punish."

16:43.480 --> 16:44.270
Also,

16:44.730 --> 16:51.380
[Constable Ghost]

16:45.270 --> 16:48.070
there's a smaller line of text above it
that reads:

16:48.200 --> 16:50.060
"For ranks below the fifth grade,

16:50.670 --> 16:52.720
execute first and report later."

16:54.030 --> 16:56.600
-The Divine Constable Bureau!
-The Divine Constable Bureau!

16:56.600 --> 16:57.440
My Lord!

16:59.490 --> 17:00.270
[Constable Ghost]

16:59.910 --> 17:01.720
I was blind and failed to recognize

17:01.720 --> 17:03.240
your esteemed presence

17:03.320 --> 17:05.480
in our Dougu County, Divine Constable!

17:05.480 --> 17:06.640
Please forgive me for

17:06.640 --> 17:08.240
not receiving you properly!

17:09.920 --> 17:11.310
The child disappearance cases

17:11.310 --> 17:12.920
and the Chunfeng Hall dismemberment case

17:12.920 --> 17:13.790
will be taken over by

17:13.790 --> 17:16.069
the Divine Constable Bureau,
starting today!

17:16.069 --> 17:17.069
That's great.

17:17.109 --> 17:18.720
I will definitely do my best

17:18.720 --> 17:19.589
to help you solve the cases.

17:19.589 --> 17:20.270
If there's anything you need,

17:20.270 --> 17:21.089
let me know anytime.

17:21.089 --> 17:25.020
-I'll definitely do my best to...
-Where's the coroner of your county?

17:26.880 --> 17:28.380
[Dougu County Office]

17:28.630 --> 17:29.030
[Coroner's Office]

17:29.680 --> 17:30.600
Lord Constable Ghost.

17:30.600 --> 17:35.640
[Coroner's Office]

17:34.270 --> 17:35.070
Lord Constable Ghost.

17:35.070 --> 17:36.330
Lord Constable Ghost.

17:36.890 --> 17:39.200
Forensic examination by the coroner
requires meticulous care

17:39.200 --> 17:40.640
and will take some time.

17:40.790 --> 17:41.590
Why not

17:41.880 --> 17:43.110
go rest in the side hall for a while?

17:43.110 --> 17:43.920
That's right.

17:44.200 --> 17:45.590
You've traveled far, My Lord,

17:45.590 --> 17:46.790
and we haven't had the chance to

17:46.790 --> 17:48.510
receive you properly.

17:57.110 --> 17:59.440
You're so diligent in official duties,
Lord Constable Ghost.

17:59.440 --> 18:00.920
I deeply admire you.

17:59.930 --> 18:01.420
[Coroner's Office]

18:03.030 --> 18:03.680
My Lord!

18:03.680 --> 18:04.480
Keep it down!

18:04.720 --> 18:05.510
My Lord.

18:05.590 --> 18:07.240
A woman has barged in from outside.

18:07.240 --> 18:07.960
Useless!

18:08.680 --> 18:10.000
You can't even stop a woman.

18:09.870 --> 18:10.930
[Coroner's Office]

18:10.270 --> 18:11.600
Where did you come from?

18:11.680 --> 18:13.340
How dare you trespass into...

18:15.000 --> 18:15.680
You got here fast.

18:15.680 --> 18:16.200
What are you looking at?

18:16.200 --> 18:17.920
-It's serious. I couldn't afford to delay.
-You...

18:17.920 --> 18:19.070
Why didn't you stop her?

18:19.070 --> 18:20.790
As you instructed, we only stop men,
not women.

18:20.790 --> 18:21.550
Nonsense!

18:27.110 --> 18:28.510
I can't believe

18:28.510 --> 18:30.030
I've been blind twice in a day.

18:30.030 --> 18:30.810
Lord Constable Ghost.

18:30.810 --> 18:32.610
This must be your wife, right?

18:32.920 --> 18:34.720
Your wife is indeed beautiful

18:34.720 --> 18:36.270
and virtuous.

18:37.590 --> 18:40.000
I'm Constable Frost Bai Zhenzhu from
the Divine Constable Bureau.

18:38.110 --> 18:39.690
[Constable Frost]

18:41.030 --> 18:42.270
So I've actually been blind

18:42.270 --> 18:43.790
3 times in a single day.

18:43.880 --> 18:46.210
Please forgive me, Lady Constable Frost.

18:48.240 --> 18:49.300
The body's inside.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.960
Their coroner is currently examining it.

18:50.960 --> 18:51.960
Let's take a look.

18:52.030 --> 18:54.030
There are so many people in the yard.

19:07.960 --> 19:08.750
My Lord,

19:09.070 --> 19:10.720
have I come late?

19:11.680 --> 19:12.740
Please forgive me.

19:13.400 --> 19:14.030
Wen Nansheng,

19:14.030 --> 19:15.830
aren't you conducting an autopsy inside?

19:15.830 --> 19:17.110
Why are you here?

19:17.250 --> 19:18.080
My Lord,

19:18.310 --> 19:20.110
there was a government officer
who asked me to come here.

19:20.110 --> 19:21.070
But just a moment later,

19:21.070 --> 19:22.310
another officer from
the Divine Constable Bureau

19:22.310 --> 19:23.590
came to my house,

19:23.790 --> 19:24.920
saying that Divine Constable

19:24.920 --> 19:26.920
wished to have a drink with you, Mr. Du,

19:26.920 --> 19:27.920
and the autopsy wasn't urgent,

19:27.920 --> 19:29.480
so he told me to come later instead.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.740
So you're the coroner?

19:37.720 --> 19:38.510
It's you.

19:38.680 --> 19:39.590
Li Qingyang?

19:39.640 --> 19:40.680
Lord Constable Ghost.

19:40.680 --> 19:41.940
Lady Constable Frost.

19:42.160 --> 19:44.110
It's indeed a small world.

19:53.590 --> 19:54.520
Leave this to me.

20:59.750 --> 21:01.070
Why do you have this?

21:09.350 --> 21:11.210
This is called the Spider's Tear.

21:11.960 --> 21:14.880
It cannot be broken by weapons,
and it's impervious to water and fire.

21:14.880 --> 21:17.590
It's extremely fine, transparent,
and incredibly sharp

21:17.590 --> 21:19.480
It can be used to control puppets,

21:19.510 --> 21:20.510
and it also serves

21:20.960 --> 21:22.550
as a weapon to kill.

21:22.750 --> 21:25.070
Even something as tough as bamboo

21:25.110 --> 21:26.710
can be severed upon contact—

21:26.720 --> 21:27.680
let alone

21:27.960 --> 21:30.000
Master Sun's flesh and blood.

21:30.200 --> 21:31.830
Then according to what you're saying,

21:31.830 --> 21:32.590
this is the tool

21:32.590 --> 21:34.790
which was used to dismember Master Sun?

21:34.960 --> 21:36.070
I've also found

21:36.590 --> 21:38.960
the place where the missing children
of Dougu County

21:38.960 --> 21:40.790
were last seen.

21:40.880 --> 21:42.070
It was this very

21:42.400 --> 21:43.550
Black Wind Forest.

21:52.920 --> 21:54.520
You seem to know an awful lot—

21:55.440 --> 21:57.510
then you must be the prime suspect.

21:57.830 --> 21:59.430
I'll place you under arrest.

22:00.400 --> 22:01.640
Let me remind you—

22:02.310 --> 22:03.830
this is the second time

22:03.830 --> 22:04.960
you've drawn your sword on me.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.030
If you still can't

22:06.350 --> 22:08.240
take my life this time,

22:08.590 --> 22:10.850
I think the title "Reaper Sword" of yours

22:11.030 --> 22:12.510
might need to be changed.

23:16.350 --> 23:17.200
Be careful.

23:18.200 --> 23:19.200
It's an illusion.

23:21.110 --> 23:24.310
How am I supposed to believe
this isn't one of your tricks?

23:56.740 --> 23:59.110
Emperor of Heaven,

23:59.160 --> 24:01.350
Emperor of Earth,

24:01.350 --> 24:06.070
I have a child who cries at night.

24:08.640 --> 24:11.550
Kind passerby,

24:11.550 --> 24:13.790
please recite this spell,

24:14.110 --> 24:19.720
and he will sleep soundly until daybreak.

25:47.590 --> 25:49.160
The illusion formation here is
far too sinister.

25:49.160 --> 25:50.560
Even I've fallen into it.

25:54.030 --> 25:56.160
I must make a clean break immediately.

25:57.390 --> 25:59.430
Master, I'm sorry.

26:00.110 --> 26:01.570
I have to break my promise.

26:29.680 --> 26:32.280
The eldest son is Zhen;
the youngest son is Gen.

26:32.430 --> 26:35.200
The child comes from the mother,
and the mother is the Kun trigram.

26:35.200 --> 26:37.460
Yin adheres to yang, whose image is fire.

26:38.550 --> 26:40.400
Adheres to actually means separate from.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.930
The "Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation"!

26:41.930 --> 26:42.930
[Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation]

26:42.930 --> 26:43.930
[Veiled-Bird Mingyi Hexagram]

27:44.240 --> 27:46.110
So this is a mass burial ground.

27:46.640 --> 27:50.300
They've used illusion techniques
to turn a graveyard into a town.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.940
That's quite unsettling.

27:58.270 --> 27:59.200
Changsuo?

28:05.960 --> 28:07.680
[Tomb of Zhang Xiaoniu,
a Child Who Died Young]

28:06.480 --> 28:07.400
Zhang Xiaoniu.

28:13.030 --> 28:13.790
Sui'er.

28:13.300 --> 28:15.660
[Tomb of Sui’er]

28:15.160 --> 28:15.960
Mr. Meng.

28:18.030 --> 28:19.640
These seem to be the names of

28:19.790 --> 28:22.050
of the missing children of Dougu County.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.030
Mr. Meng.

28:25.270 --> 28:26.110
Mr. Meng!

29:01.480 --> 29:03.010
These are all empty graves.

29:03.200 --> 29:04.640
Why are they all empty?

29:05.830 --> 29:07.830
These children must still be alive.

29:13.270 --> 29:17.200
Help me! Help me!

29:17.200 --> 29:21.030
Somebody help me! Help me!

29:21.310 --> 29:23.030
Help me!

29:23.030 --> 29:24.230
They're still alive!

29:25.640 --> 29:26.440
Li Si!

29:26.790 --> 29:28.000
The children are still alive!

29:28.000 --> 29:28.800
Hang in there!

29:29.240 --> 29:30.510
Help me!

29:30.640 --> 29:32.640
Spirit pivot, circulation and return,
yin and yang are unfathomable.

29:32.640 --> 29:33.440
Break!

29:39.790 --> 29:40.880
See for yourself

29:41.000 --> 29:42.310
what you're holding.

29:44.160 --> 29:45.420
It was illusion again.

29:46.160 --> 29:46.960
Mr. Meng.

29:47.440 --> 29:48.960
This place is way too strange.

29:48.960 --> 29:50.270
If we stay here,

29:50.270 --> 29:51.680
both of us will die.

29:51.880 --> 29:52.680
Let's go.

30:18.160 --> 30:19.830
That was really close.

30:31.070 --> 30:32.400
Dragon-whisker Grass?

30:38.480 --> 30:41.160
Dragon-whisker Grass grows in
the most barren and treacherous lands.

30:41.160 --> 30:42.220
As the saying goes,

30:42.310 --> 30:45.590
one does not see dragon whisker
unless one reaches absolute extremity.

30:45.590 --> 30:46.720
This material

30:46.790 --> 30:47.920
is extremely tough,

30:48.270 --> 30:50.870
and it's most commonly used for
weaving shoes.

30:51.750 --> 30:53.480
Using it to make a sword sheath,

30:53.960 --> 30:55.880
however, is something
I've never heard of before.

30:55.880 --> 30:57.680
Using softness to overcome hardness.

30:57.680 --> 31:00.480
This sword is extremely rigid
and bone-chilling.

31:00.480 --> 31:01.720
Only the resilience of cattail reeds

31:01.720 --> 31:02.720
can withstand it.

31:03.720 --> 31:04.960
Rumor has it that

31:05.350 --> 31:08.440
Constable Ghost carries a sword,
known as "Reaper."

31:09.160 --> 31:11.000
My sword is named "Severe-Cold."

31:11.000 --> 31:12.030
As for "Reaper",

31:12.750 --> 31:13.720
it's nothing more than a rumor

31:13.720 --> 31:16.440
that's been passed around and exaggerated
in jianghu.

31:16.440 --> 31:18.270
So it actually has its own name,

31:18.230 --> 31:21.520
[Severe-Cold]

31:19.400 --> 31:20.830
"Severe-Cold."

31:22.030 --> 31:23.720
What a good name.

31:25.480 --> 31:27.280
What was that technique you used

31:27.680 --> 31:29.680
back at the gate of Tianshu Pavilion

31:30.110 --> 31:32.040
and in the hallucination just now?

31:32.470 --> 31:34.240
The Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation.

31:34.240 --> 31:36.030
It borrows the power of heaven, earth,
mountain, and marsh,

31:36.030 --> 31:38.070
using wind, thunder, water, and fire
to attack enemies.

31:38.070 --> 31:39.200
It's just like

31:40.030 --> 31:41.310
flying a kite—

31:41.480 --> 31:42.680
without wind,

31:42.790 --> 31:44.640
the kite can't rise no matter what.

31:44.640 --> 31:45.440
But

31:45.830 --> 31:46.790
once you get

31:46.790 --> 31:48.790
the wind's strength and direction

31:49.030 --> 31:50.440
and calculate it precisely,

31:50.440 --> 31:51.310
the kite

31:51.590 --> 31:53.440
naturally takes flight.

31:53.640 --> 31:56.720
That is what it means
to borrow the power of nature.

32:02.030 --> 32:03.510
This Heaven-Measuring Ruler
is a divine artifact

32:03.510 --> 32:06.070
forged from a meteorite
beyond the heavens.

32:06.310 --> 32:07.070
It can

32:07.310 --> 32:09.510
precisely measure the qi and energy flows
of all things,

32:09.510 --> 32:11.240
and harness them for my own use.

32:11.440 --> 32:13.550
Just like that formation from earlier.

32:13.550 --> 32:16.750
In the illusion formation,
there were children and fire,

32:16.750 --> 32:18.960
which corresponded exactly to
the Mingyi hexagram.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.510
And I was able to transform it

32:20.510 --> 32:22.270
into the "Earth Fire Mingyi" formation

32:22.270 --> 32:24.130
to break the illusion formation.

32:25.270 --> 32:28.510
And that's the Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation.

32:28.510 --> 32:31.310
Resolving all kinds of techniques
with one ruler?

32:33.880 --> 32:34.680
Not bad.

32:35.880 --> 32:38.340
That's a very effective method
for killing.

32:40.920 --> 32:42.550
Lord Constable Ghost, so you're

32:42.550 --> 32:43.880
still suspecting me?

32:47.350 --> 32:48.440
I'm a constable,

32:49.240 --> 32:50.440
and you're a suspect.

32:51.110 --> 32:52.200
What do you think?

32:53.160 --> 32:55.030
Ever since
the Young Girl Spice-Refining Case,

32:55.030 --> 32:56.570
you've first trespassed into
the Tianshu Pavilion

32:56.570 --> 32:58.350
as a suspect,

32:58.510 --> 32:59.310
and now,

32:59.310 --> 33:00.480
you've followed us
all the way to Dougu County,

33:00.480 --> 33:02.310
and even appeared here
in this Black Wind Forest.

33:02.310 --> 33:04.200
All you speak of is the case.

33:04.720 --> 33:06.350
If you're not the true culprit,

33:06.350 --> 33:08.410
then you must be up to something else.

33:08.550 --> 33:09.750
Whatever the reason,

33:12.240 --> 33:14.840
you can explain it back
at the Bureau yourself.

33:16.590 --> 33:18.270
Lady Moon,

33:18.530 --> 33:26.900
[Spring Blossoms, Autumn Harvest]

33:19.000 --> 33:20.640
shine upon the eastern wall.

33:21.480 --> 33:25.510
In the depths of the alley,
there is honeyed candy.

33:26.400 --> 33:28.110
Follow me,

33:28.880 --> 33:30.640
make no sound—

33:31.270 --> 33:35.480
I'll dress you in a paper garment.

33:36.510 --> 33:38.200
The road before the door

33:38.640 --> 33:40.480
leads to my homeland.

33:41.920 --> 33:45.830
In my house,
there's a piece of crystal candy,

33:46.720 --> 33:51.200
buried beneath the tree
with the scent of bones.

33:56.070 --> 33:56.880
Youyou.

33:57.270 --> 33:58.070
Cuicui.

33:58.680 --> 33:59.590
Yuanbao.

34:00.640 --> 34:01.510
Man.

34:02.070 --> 34:02.920
Nu.

34:03.000 --> 34:04.200
Yingzi.

34:04.920 --> 34:06.720
Come out and play.

34:09.190 --> 34:10.110
Come on.

34:10.800 --> 34:11.840
Come on.

34:12.280 --> 34:14.320
Come and play.

34:19.110 --> 34:20.840
The wind is cold,

34:21.280 --> 34:23.030
the night is long.

34:23.880 --> 34:28.630
Obedient little kid,
sleep soundly and sweet.

34:29.630 --> 34:31.360
Close your eyes

34:32.230 --> 34:34.350
and sing with me.

34:35.070 --> 34:40.510
In a few steps,
you'll be by your mother's side.

34:40.710 --> 34:43.230
[In the second month of spring,]

34:41.270 --> 34:44.850
[Hongyun Era,]

34:43.230 --> 34:44.230
[Dashi Dynasty,]

34:44.670 --> 34:46.000
[in Dougu County, Suzhou,]

34:46.000 --> 34:47.030
[6 more children]

34:47.030 --> 34:49.030
[went missing overnight.]

34:49.480 --> 34:51.030
[The total number of missing children]

34:51.030 --> 34:53.190
[has now risen to 35.]

34:55.110 --> 34:56.110
My poor daughter!

34:55.420 --> 34:58.190
[Dougu County Office]

34:56.110 --> 34:58.110
Officers, please help us look for them!

34:58.110 --> 34:59.030
Exactly!

34:59.030 --> 34:59.800
Officers!

35:00.320 --> 35:01.400
What should we do?

35:01.400 --> 35:02.670
-Get up now. Get up.
-We have no idea

35:02.670 --> 35:03.480
where your children are, either!

35:03.480 --> 35:04.920
Help me look for Yuanbao, please!

35:04.920 --> 35:06.510
We've already issued a notice!

35:06.510 --> 35:07.480
Go back now!

35:08.550 --> 35:09.190
My Lord.

35:09.190 --> 35:11.190
Please help me look for Yuanbao.

35:11.230 --> 35:12.550
Go home! Go home!

35:12.840 --> 35:14.480
Maybe you simply
didn't watch them properly,

35:14.480 --> 35:15.410
and the children

35:15.590 --> 35:16.360
ran off on their own.

35:16.360 --> 35:17.280
Am I right?

35:17.280 --> 35:18.190
That's right.

35:19.230 --> 35:20.150
Go back!

35:20.230 --> 35:21.440
I'm so sorry, kid.

35:21.440 --> 35:22.670
Get up and go back.

35:22.670 --> 35:23.480
Even if you kneel here,

35:23.480 --> 35:24.670
there's nothing we can do.

35:24.670 --> 35:27.320
We've already done what we could
and issued a notice.

35:27.320 --> 35:29.710
To abduct so many children
in a single night...

35:29.710 --> 35:31.040
This is sheer audacity.

35:31.510 --> 35:32.590
No matter what,

35:32.800 --> 35:33.960
targeting children

35:34.440 --> 35:35.440
is unforgivable.

35:36.960 --> 35:37.670
My Lord!

35:37.670 --> 35:38.360
Stop kneeling here!

35:38.360 --> 35:39.840
Go back now.

35:40.480 --> 35:41.960
Move! Move!

35:42.190 --> 35:44.110
Get up! Get up!

35:44.110 --> 35:45.320
-Come on, leave!
-Go home. Go home.

35:45.320 --> 35:46.070
Stop kneeling here!

35:46.070 --> 35:46.360
Hurry up.

35:46.360 --> 35:47.070
Stop!

35:55.670 --> 35:56.480
Yuyao.

35:56.880 --> 35:57.630
Yuyao.

35:57.630 --> 35:59.150
Mrs. Hua, don't worry.

35:59.190 --> 36:01.190
The lady and gentleman
from the Divine Constable Bureau

36:01.190 --> 36:02.840
will definitely bring Yuanbao

36:02.840 --> 36:03.840
back.

36:07.070 --> 36:07.760
Yuyao stayed with me

36:07.760 --> 36:09.380
at the county government
all night last night.

36:09.380 --> 36:13.160
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

36:09.630 --> 36:10.480
Mrs. Hua.

36:10.800 --> 36:12.070
With Yuyao's current situation,

36:12.070 --> 36:13.590
can she stay at your place for a few days?

36:13.590 --> 36:15.070
Once the case is solved,
we'll come to pick her up.

36:15.070 --> 36:15.710
Don't worry.

36:15.710 --> 36:17.070
I'll have someone protect her.

36:17.070 --> 36:17.760
Okay.

36:18.510 --> 36:19.800
Alright then, good girl.

36:19.800 --> 36:20.840
From today onward,

36:20.840 --> 36:22.550
you'll be staying at my home.

36:26.510 --> 36:27.440
My Lord, My Lady.

36:27.840 --> 36:29.030
This is not the first time

36:29.030 --> 36:30.510
this kind of thing has happened.

36:30.510 --> 36:32.000
The first few times
the children went missing,

36:32.000 --> 36:33.030
a few parents came to cry

36:32.090 --> 36:34.040
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

36:33.030 --> 36:34.320
at our gate too.

36:34.320 --> 36:36.590
I also felt deeply sorry for them.

36:36.800 --> 36:37.840
But over time,

36:37.840 --> 36:39.440
they kept making a scene
at the gate of the county government.

36:39.440 --> 36:40.510
This is, after all, a government office

36:40.510 --> 36:42.630
-and a courtroom—it simply isn't proper...
-Folks.

36:42.630 --> 36:44.630
Punishing evil and protecting the people

36:43.620 --> 36:45.380
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

36:44.630 --> 36:45.920
is the duty of our Divine Constable Bureau

36:45.920 --> 36:48.480
-and the local authorities.
-Of course. Of course.

36:48.480 --> 36:49.590
Please rest assured.

36:49.590 --> 36:49.840
We'll definitely

36:49.840 --> 36:51.280
bring the missing children back,

36:51.280 --> 36:52.670
and we'll make those
who commit these crimes

36:52.670 --> 36:53.840
confess and face justice.

36:53.010 --> 36:53.930
[Dougu County Office]

36:54.320 --> 36:55.840
Please seek justice for us, My Lady!

36:55.840 --> 36:56.480
Thank you, My Lady!

36:56.480 --> 36:57.190
Thank you.

36:57.840 --> 37:00.000
Well said, Lady Constable Frost.

37:01.000 --> 37:02.360
How many children have gone missing?

37:02.360 --> 37:03.150
Six.

37:03.230 --> 37:03.840
Was there no disturbance at all

37:03.840 --> 37:05.070
in the county last night?

37:05.070 --> 37:06.920
Not a sound, not a trace.

37:07.070 --> 37:08.600
No one knows how it was done.

37:19.590 --> 37:21.250
This doesn't concern with me.

37:23.710 --> 37:24.510
Mr. Du,

37:24.300 --> 37:27.450
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

37:24.920 --> 37:25.800
may I borrow your courtroom?

37:25.800 --> 37:27.030
Please suit yourself, My Lady.

37:27.030 --> 37:27.800
Hold on.

37:27.800 --> 37:28.800
Record all the information these people

37:28.800 --> 37:29.510
have provided about the children—

37:29.510 --> 37:30.510
their circumstances,
their home addresses,

37:30.510 --> 37:31.280
and family members.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.400
-Take everything down.
-Got it.

37:32.400 --> 37:35.060
-We'll fetch some paper and brushes.
-Let's go.

37:37.590 --> 37:39.070
-Everyone, please go home.
-Please go home.

37:39.070 --> 37:40.510
Go on. Don't stand here.

37:40.510 --> 37:41.230
Go on.

37:41.230 --> 37:42.510
Go on. Go on.

37:43.510 --> 37:44.280
Go back home.

37:44.280 --> 37:45.070
Go home.

37:48.190 --> 37:49.000
How weird.

37:50.000 --> 37:52.450
[Dougu County Office]

37:53.230 --> 37:54.630
I was examining the body in the morgue
last night,

37:54.630 --> 37:55.230
and I didn't hear

37:55.230 --> 37:56.590
any unusual movement.

37:56.670 --> 37:58.230
Did anyone see the puppet doll?

37:58.230 --> 37:58.920
I've asked about it.

37:58.920 --> 37:59.670
No one did.

38:00.190 --> 38:00.840
That person

38:00.840 --> 38:02.230
abducted 6 children

38:02.230 --> 38:04.000
without anyone noticing.

38:04.320 --> 38:06.650
He must have used highly unusual methods.

38:07.230 --> 38:07.960
We should still

38:07.960 --> 38:10.110
start by investigating the puppet doll.

38:10.110 --> 38:11.510
Didn't witnesses report

38:11.920 --> 38:13.440
seeing them at the scenes

38:13.630 --> 38:15.440
of the earlier disappearances?

38:20.920 --> 38:21.760
Last night, he deliberately

38:21.760 --> 38:22.710
led me to the Black Wind Forest.

38:22.710 --> 38:23.970
Lady Constable Frost.

38:24.320 --> 38:25.070
We found

38:25.070 --> 38:26.880
the missing children's empty graves.

38:26.880 --> 38:27.630
Besides,

38:28.320 --> 38:29.480
I also found that

38:29.880 --> 38:32.070
the silk thread that got Master Sun killed

38:32.070 --> 38:33.070
can not only be used

38:33.070 --> 38:34.600
to control the puppet doll—

38:34.710 --> 38:36.340
many martial artists also often

38:36.340 --> 38:38.030
use it as a stealth weapon.

38:38.230 --> 38:40.360
It's called the Spider's Tear.

38:40.920 --> 38:41.840
No matter how I see it,

38:41.840 --> 38:43.510
you are the most suspicious.

38:44.550 --> 38:45.320
But last night,

38:45.320 --> 38:47.070
I was in Black Wind Forest with him.

38:47.070 --> 38:48.400
So when the children went missing,

38:48.400 --> 38:49.510
you were together all along?

38:49.510 --> 38:50.360
Exactly.

38:51.320 --> 38:53.070
So you should know

38:53.280 --> 38:55.150
the case has nothing to do with me.

38:55.440 --> 38:56.280
We should start with

38:56.280 --> 38:57.800
the puppet doll.

39:01.030 --> 39:02.230
You wouldn't listen to reason

39:02.230 --> 39:04.230
and insisted on taking the hard way.

39:05.190 --> 39:06.550
What else can I say?

39:07.440 --> 39:09.110
He may have other accomplices.

39:09.110 --> 39:10.320
The Chief wants to interrogate him.

39:10.320 --> 39:12.320
I'll take him back to Tianhuang City.

39:12.320 --> 39:14.000
It's dangerous for you to go alone.

39:14.000 --> 39:14.920
He's cunning.

39:15.190 --> 39:16.030
Once the case is solved,

39:16.030 --> 39:17.560
let's escort him together.

39:17.590 --> 39:18.400
Okay.

39:18.160 --> 39:19.190
[Just and Upright] [The People First]

39:21.400 --> 39:22.460
What are you doing?

39:24.000 --> 39:25.400
This item is suspicious.

39:25.440 --> 39:26.630
I can't leave it with you.

39:26.630 --> 39:27.800
How ungrateful,

39:27.800 --> 39:29.060
Lord Constable Ghost.

39:30.000 --> 39:31.030
You did save me,

39:31.400 --> 39:32.880
but I'm just doing my job.

39:33.230 --> 39:34.320
A weapon of this kind

39:34.320 --> 39:36.520
cannot be left in the hands of a suspect.

39:37.800 --> 39:39.000
Bad news! Bad news!

39:39.440 --> 39:40.710
Something bad happened!

39:39.530 --> 39:42.530
[Just and Upright] [The People First]

39:41.190 --> 39:43.030
Master Sun's body disappeared!

39:43.070 --> 39:44.110
What do you mean it disappeared?

39:44.110 --> 39:46.000
The morgue is completely empty.

39:46.000 --> 39:46.880
Not a single one of

39:46.880 --> 39:48.740
the dismembered remains is left!

39:49.000 --> 39:50.880
I examined the corpse alone last night

39:50.880 --> 39:52.010
until 3 to 5 o'clock.

39:52.840 --> 39:53.960
Stealing a corpse

39:54.230 --> 39:55.840
is usually done to prevent anything

39:55.840 --> 39:58.400
from being discovered
during an examination.

39:58.400 --> 39:59.860
But Lady Constable Frost,

40:00.360 --> 40:01.110
we've already extracted

40:01.110 --> 40:02.670
nearly everything we needed
from the remains.

40:02.670 --> 40:04.360
So what would be the purpose of

40:04.670 --> 40:05.920
taking the body away at a time like this?

40:05.920 --> 40:06.630
Weren't there guards

40:06.630 --> 40:07.800
at the door of the morgue?

40:07.800 --> 40:08.320
Well...

40:08.320 --> 40:09.510
According to Your Lordship's instruction,

40:09.510 --> 40:11.440
there were guards there all along.

40:12.230 --> 40:13.110
Then how did they manage to do that

40:13.110 --> 40:14.280
without anyone noticing?

40:14.280 --> 40:15.710
Isn't it obvious?

40:16.230 --> 40:17.960
They didn't steal or snatch it—

40:18.320 --> 40:20.030
they took it away

40:20.480 --> 40:21.940
openly and legitimately.

40:23.480 --> 40:25.070
So who could enter the morgue

40:25.070 --> 40:27.440
in a perfectly natural way,
without raising suspicion?

40:27.440 --> 40:28.480
Unless

40:28.480 --> 40:29.540
it was the coroner.

40:29.630 --> 40:30.440
Where is Wen Nansheng?

40:30.440 --> 40:31.110
Call him here!

40:31.110 --> 40:32.110
I saw him

40:32.110 --> 40:33.320
leaving the county government
carrying a bundle

40:33.320 --> 40:34.360
and heading west.

40:36.030 --> 40:37.110
Divine Constables!

40:37.110 --> 40:38.190
Keep a close watch on the suspect, Li Si!

40:38.190 --> 40:39.110
Got it! Got it!

40:39.590 --> 40:40.360
He's in my custody.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.560
You can rest assured!

40:42.480 --> 40:43.280
Guards!

40:43.280 --> 40:43.880
Yes!

40:43.880 --> 40:45.400
Lock this guy up in prison.

40:49.760 --> 40:50.550
Where is he?

40:51.400 --> 40:52.360
Where did he go?

41:06.070 --> 41:06.880
Meng.

41:07.070 --> 41:08.110
There's the scent of Dead Bone Spice

41:08.110 --> 41:09.480
on Master Sun's dismembered remains.

41:09.480 --> 41:10.480
Wen Nansheng didn't go far.

41:10.480 --> 41:11.740
Can you still smell it?

41:18.230 --> 41:19.070
This way.

41:19.110 --> 41:20.170
[Hefeng Tavern]

41:52.630 --> 41:53.400
Stop it!
